(READ-AFM-FILE
  [LAMBDA (FILE BOLDNESS ITALICNESS)                         (* ; 
                                                        "Edited  5-Aug-93 16:37 by sybalskY:MV:ENVOS")

    (* ;; 
    "Read an Adobe-version-3 AFM file, and extract the metrics from it for making a PSCFONT file.")

